        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana EPT425, Thin Door Edge Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe thin door edge pull can be used for swing doors or sliding doors. When used on a swinging door, it is mortised in the door's edge. That way, the pull is concealed when the door is closed (only a small portion of the pull's top projects from the door). Just flip the hidden pull out to open the door. For sliding door applications, the door pull can be surface mounted or mortised into the door's face. Very thin 1/4\" width allows for surface mounting on most pocket door applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"286\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-EPT425-Specifications.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"286\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana EPT425 Solid Brass Edge Pull Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n If a pocket door opening does not have at least a 1/4\" clearance, the pull can be mortised. The Solid Brass Thin Edge Pull is available in 8 great finishes and comes packaged with matching finish installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana EPT425 Door Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Lever Opening: 170 Degrees</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EPT425.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana EPT425 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Thin Door Edge Pull | Deltana EPT425",
                "description": "Thin Edge Pull for Sliding or Swinging Doors, Deltana EPT425 - The Thin Pocket Door Edge Pull can be used for swing doors or sliding doors. When used on a swinging door, it is mortised in the door's edge. That way, the pull is concealed when the door is closed (only a small portion of the pull's top projects from the door). Just flip the hidden pull out to open the door. For sliding door applications, the door pull can be surface mounted or mortised into the door's face. Very thin 1/4 inch width allows for surface mounting on most pocket door applications. If a pocket door opening does not have at least a 1/4 inch clearance, the pull can be mortised. The Solid Brass Thin Edge Pull is available in 8 great finishes and comes packaged with matching finish installation screws.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-EPT425 Thin Door Edge Pulls, Solid Brass Thin Edge Pulls, Deltana EPT425 Edge pulls, pull for edge of doors, hidden door pulls, invisible pulls, invisible door pulls, DEL-EPT425U3, DEL-EPT425U5, DEL-EPT425U10B, DEL-EPT425U15, DEL-EPT425U15A, DEL-EPT425U26, DEL-EPT425U26D, DEL-EPT425CR003,"
